---
title: Sequence Diagram 3 – Daily Revenue and Monthly Sales Graph
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor Owner as Shop Owner
  participant UI as Reports Page
  participant API as Flask API
  participant DB as SQLite DB
  Owner->>UI: pick a date
  UI->>API: GET /api/reports/daily-revenue?date=YYYY-MM-DD
  API->>DB: SUM(amount) of sales on that date
  DB-->>API: total
  API-->>UI: {date, revenue}
  UI-->>Owner: show revenue
  Owner->>UI: pick a month
  UI->>API: GET /api/reports/monthly-sales?month=YYYY-MM
  API->>DB: SUM(amount) GROUP BY sale_date for that month
  DB-->>API: rows (only days that had sales)
  Note over API: fill missing days with 0
  API-->>UI: [{day, revenue}, ...] one per day
  UI->>UI: JavaScript draws one bar per day
  UI-->>Owner: graph of sales for each day
